			"text": "It was narrated from Anas that some people from ‘Urainah came to the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) but they were averse to the climate of Al- Madinah. He (ﷺ) said:“Why don’t you go out to a flock of camels of ours, and drink their milk and urine.” And they did that",
